            "body": "Judging both by the 'minimal.lua' and error message, this has nothing to do with 'mini.ai'. Both `[f` and `]f` are defined in 'nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter-textobjects' (in [these lines](https://dpaste.org/UsoQA#L67,68,69,70)).\r\n\r\nClosing as not related to 'mini.nvim'.",
